{"id":"97e1c321780e0cae","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-first-order-fibration-compat.md","title":"first-order-fibration — 历史入口","display":"first-order-fibration — 历史入口","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-first-order-fibration-compat","aliases":["16-df-first-order-fibration-compat","16-first-order-fibration"],"display":"first-order-fibration — 历史入口","depends_on":["[[16-df-first-order-fibration]]"],"source":"Definition 4.2.1(iii), p. 233 (PDF 253)","revision_date":"2026-10-07"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-first-order-fibration-compat"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-first-order-fibration-compat</span><span>16-first-order-fibration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"first-order-fibration — 历史入口"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"66d3058a6ae62dc5\" href=\"?note=66d3058a6ae62dc5\" title=\"16-df-first-order-fibration\">16-df-first-order-fibration</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 4.2.1(iii), p. 233 (PDF 253)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-07"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 为纤维化，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOFib}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOFib}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"66d3058a6ae62dc5\" href=\"?note=66d3058a6ae62dc5\" title=\"16-df-first-order-fibration\">16-df-first-order-fibration</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOFib}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOFib}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}\\)</span> 为旧拼写。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}fibration}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{FOFib}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{FOFib}(p).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}fibration}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{FOFib}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{FOFib}(p).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>一阶结构包括 coherent 结构、纤维 CCC 与满足简单 BC 的全称量词。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，Definition 4.2.1(iii), p. 233 (PDF 253)。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-first-order-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"66d3058a6ae62dc5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-first-order-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-first-order-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"66d3058a6ae62dc5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p$ 为纤维化，$\\mathrm{FOFib}$ 见 [[16-df-first-order-fibration]]，$\\mathrm{FOFib}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}$ 为旧拼写。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOFib}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOFib}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}fibration}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{FOFib}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{FOFib}(p).","display":true}],"bytes":935,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-241","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-first-order-fibration-compat|first-order-fibration — 历史入口]]"}],"outgoing":["66d3058a6ae62dc5"]}